<title>NETHERLANDS: Montell Q3 profits up.</title>
<headline>Montell Q3 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Operating results		  101    vs  61</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue		  932    vs 903</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			727    vs 741</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 205    vs 162</p>
<p>Selling costs, general,</p>
<p>    adminstrative and R&amp;D costs    104    vs 101</p>
<p>NOTE - Montell Polyolefins is a 50/50 plastics joint venture between Royal Dutch/Shell  and Italy's Montedison.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
